{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30917","headline":"寄金州姚使君员外 · 马戴","name":"寄金州姚使君员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老怀清净化，乞去守洵阳。\n废井人应满，空林虎自藏。\n迸泉疎石窦，残雨发椒香。\n山缺通巴峡，江流带楚樯。\n忧农生野思，祷庙结云装。\n覆局松移影，听琴月堕光。\n鸟鸣开郡印，僧去置禅牀。\n罢贡金休凿，凌寒笋更长。\n退公披鹤氅，高步隔鵷行。\n相见朱门内，麾幢拂曙霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}